{
  "id": 492186858,
  "iid": 25236,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "IPv6: store proto_data correlated to pinfo->layers",
  "description": "When adding IPv6 proto_data to pinfo, discriminate with curr_layer_num\n(which correlates 1:1 with pinfo->layers), rather than\ncurr_proto_layer_num (which only counts instances of the IPv6 layer\nitself).  This benefits other dissectors that want the IPv6 proto_data\nfor a specific layer instance (such as UET).\n\nAlso add an accessor function for fetching a specific layer's proto_data.\nThis encapsulates the bit encoding of layer_num so other dissectors don'\nneed to replicate it.\n\nThis updates !25160\n\nSigned-off-by: Alex Badea <alex.badea@keysight.com>",
