          "id": 3424087126,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Hunh. TIL.   So I suppose the pinos are now unable to find their IPv6 pinfo.\n\nI've rewritten this MR to add a separate proto_data;  then UET can use it like this https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/merge_requests/25143/diffs?commit_id=541b5154dc5ec05d2f883c4d82ba129c3880220b\n\nIf this MR is not acceptable that's fine, uet can use the proto_ipv6-layer-counting logic.",
